contentText:
Even with all her fame and riches, Cardi B is still loyal to shopping at Old Navy . She became the face of Old Navy&#8217;s fall 2026 denim campaign, and the Grammy-winning rapper called the partnership a &#8220;full-circle&#8221; moment while recalling the days of shoplifting at the store as a kid.

